      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DELICATE RULER (5) is hard to knock on his recent form, winning impressively two back before a 0.3L defeat most recently. He'll need his early speed to get across, but his last two figures stack right up. Form out of his last start has been good and he can get the job done this time. FIRE THE GUARD (3)  improved sharply second-up when winning by 2.7L at this track and trip 10 days ago after a disappointing fresh run. O'Donnell remains in the irons and things look to set up nicely once again third-up into the campaign. Can play a leading role. UNIVERSAL PLAYBOY (4) was off a short break here last time where he was well beaten by Now You See Me. This looks a little easier on paper and he's unbeaten at this track and trip. Can take up the running and will be tough to run down. OUTLAW MUSIC (9) has to be included on the back of a strong run last time out. BUSTER'S GIRL (6) is third-up now and can improve.",
